# Security Policy

## Reporting a Vulnerability

If you discover a security vulnerability in {{.ProjectName}}, please report it responsibly.

**Please do NOT open a public issue.**

Instead, send an email with details of the vulnerability. Include:

1. Description of the vulnerability
2. Steps to reproduce
3. Potential impact
4. Suggested fix (if any)

## Supported Versions

| Version | Supported |
| ------- | --------- |
| latest  | ✅        |

## Security Updates

Security updates will be released as patch versions and announced via GitHub releases.
